('mission-bottle-6', 'bottle', 'mission', 'Bottle Shoot', 'game', 1, array['any','sports','access','gate','parking','testing','stg']::text[], 'Scout is on the gun range: shoot the glass bottles — each colour hides one digit. Intel knows which colours open the safe, in order. Decoder knows how to scramble the code.', '{"scout":{"title":"Gun range","body":"Tap a bottle to shoot it. A broken bottle shows its digit; every bottle of that colour hides the same digit. 6 shots, then reload. Shout every colour and digit you find.","game":{"type":"bottle","bottles":[{"c":"red","d":3},{"c":"blue","d":8},{"c":"green","d":0},{"c":"yellow","d":9},{"c":"purple","d":6},{"c":"orange","d":4}],"ammo":6}},"intel":{"title":"Safe order","body":"RED  →  PURPLE  →  YELLOW  →  ORANGE","big":true},"decoder":{"title":"Scramble rule","body":"Add 1 to every digit (9 becomes 0)."}}'::jsonb, '[{"label":"4-digit safe code","accept":["4705"]}]'::jsonb, false, 3, 200, 'Scout: call out "red is 3, blue is 7…". Intel: read the four colours in order. Decoder: apply the rule last.', 'Red=3 Purple=6 Yellow=9 Orange=4 → +1 to each digit → 4705', null, 25, 'published'),
